{
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "text": "没钱的时候，亲戚躲着您走；",
      "characters": 13,
      "duration_ms": 2880,
      "duration_sec": 2.88,
      "trace_id": "0740bdd341fc443490a1fd49f3e122c0"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "text": "有钱了，八竿子打不着的亲戚也找上门了——这口气，您咽过吗？",
      "characters": 29,
      "duration_ms": 6660,
      "duration_sec": 6.66,
      "trace_id": "0740bdd59bd4b9ec3d2f91a2e78c9f4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "text": "老话说得一点不客气：贫居闹市无人问，富在深山有远亲。",
      "characters": 26,
      "duration_ms": 7200,
      "duration_sec": 7.2,
      "trace_id": "0740bdd7648e85db5e494216ab6fe912"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "text": "这句就收在《被遗忘的后半句》里，第二章处事智慧，第47条，前半句后半句一个字没改。",
      "characters": 41,
      "duration_ms": 10764,
      "duration_sec": 10.76,
      "trace_id": "0740bdda81ece14205a398edc53e3322"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "text": "听着扎心，可句句是真话。",
      "characters": 12,
      "duration_ms": 3132,
      "duration_sec": 3.13,
      "trace_id": "0740c6c3eec091e58f39b48ecfddf110"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "text": "穷的时候没人问，不是您人缘差，是人情这东西，历来先看冷暖再看亲疏。",
      "characters": 33,
      "duration_ms": 8028,
      "duration_sec": 8.03,
      "trace_id": "0740bdde5d9d315bc7cb031297114f18"
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "text": "看明白了，就别往心里记仇，也别拿热脸再去贴冷脸：",
      "characters": 24,
      "duration_ms": 5724,
      "duration_sec": 5.72,
      "trace_id": "0740bde008977e47f98ea56ac1574266"
    },
    {
      "id": "A08",
      "text": "该走动的走动，该远的远着，往后谁真心对您，您心里有数就行，不用逢人就掏心窝子。",
      "characters": 39,
      "duration_ms": 9684,
      "duration_sec": 9.68,
      "trace_id": "0740bde27c045d4819edfab869ba8f8f"
    },
    {
      "id": "A09",
      "text": "日子是自己过的，不是演给亲戚看的。",
      "characters": 17,
      "duration_ms": 3312,
      "duration_sec": 3.31,
      "trace_id": "0740bde5626f33a7d7802b7c59f812ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "A10",
      "text": "您家，有过这种亲戚吗？",
      "characters": 11,
      "duration_ms": 2556,
      "duration_sec": 2.56,
      "trace_id": "0740bde7c448d86b365fb85e9023a0c2"
    }
  ],
  "total_duration_ms": 59940,
  "total_characters": 245,
  "role": "grandpa",
  "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
  "engine": "minimax",
